      "writtenOn": "2023-07-11T06:31:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I investigated the cases when `client.stats \u003d\u003d null`, and it the most probable suspect seems to a race condition between registering a scanner and retrieving a scanner during scanning with pending intent. In [`GattService.continuePiStartScan`](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/refs/heads/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/gatt/GattService.java;l\u003d3336;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d1), `client.stats` is assigned only if scanner is retrieved from `mScannerMap`, seems like the retrieval process might happen before scanner registration is done and scanner is added to `mScannerMap`. \n\nBesides the investigation, the current fix in this CL seems valid, so will try to merge the CL to fix the NPE situation.",
      "parentUuid": "1b1d2e33_42413789",
      "revId": "de3f22de2a1022133f6f9ad25c657437e8d4d30e",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
